    {
      "key": "47df49c7-eba4-41bd-b89f-729f2ea953a1",
      "position": 4,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-desktop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Transition:** Direct students to Lesson 8, Level 5 to complete the End of Lesson Survey.",
